    "<div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:783.8594px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "The tab covers the whole window, its bar and every pane around it. Escape or the same button brings it back. Full screen in the tab's right-</div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:14px;width:195.76563px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
