    "<div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:208px;height:16px;font:normal 400 14px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(230,235,243,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:16px;line-height:16px;\">",
    "Alt moves and resizes windows</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div class=\"beui-frame\" style=\"left:0px;top:36px;\">",
    "<div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;width:800.4531px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "A dock can be given a drag modifier, which is off unless asked for. While it is held, dragging anywhere in a window, its bar and tabs included, </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:14px;width:796.5px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:0.453125px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "moves the whole window, and dragging with the right button resizes it from its nearest edge or corner, or moves the split nearest the pointer </div>",
    "</div>",
    "<div style=\"left:0px;top:28px;width:567.34375px;height:14px;font:normal 400 12px Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;color:rgba(141,153,174,1);\">",
    "<div style=\"left:-0.5px;top:0px;height:14px;line-height:14px;\">",
    "in a docked pane. Nothing in the dock or its tabs sees those presses. The Linux desktop uses Super.</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
    "</div>",
